    "content": "# UD Coefficient Provenance Ledger v0.39\n\n**Date:** 2026-08-22  \n**Status:** `LOCKED_CURRENT_BASELINE__GLOBAL_GLUED_SUPPORT_AND_EQUAL_SHARE_CELL_SUPPORT_2026-08-22`  \n**Physical promotion:** 0\n\nTracks **235 typed objects**.\n\n## Global support-gluing closure\n\n- `Q169-Q173`: global support generator, control-volume continuity, cell-core flow, face reservoir, hard face gating.\n- `Q174-Q176`: exact A/B/C glued support spectra and no-global-recurrence theorem.\n- `Q177-Q179`: unique equal-top-star cell support allocation and exact cell continuity.\n\nSupport gluing and ownership are closed mathematically. Full recursive support remains open only at open-system semantics.\n\n### AUTO_LOCK\n`COEFFICIENT_PROVENANCE_LEDGER_V0_39_IS_CURRENT_BASELINE_RULE_v0.39`\n\n### AUTO_FREEZE\n`COEFFICIENT_PROVENANCE_LEDGER_V0_38_USED_AS_CURRENT_AFTER_V0_39`\n\n## Canonical ledger\n\n| ID | Symbol | Exact form | Claim bin | Status | Next gate |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| P01 | V(K4) | 4 | EXACT_INTERNAL | ACTIVE ROOT GENERATOR | none for count; physical dimension interpretations remain downstream |\n| P02 | E(K4) | 6 | EXACT_INTERNAL | ACTIVE ROOT GENERATOR | none for count |\n| P03 | \\|Aut(K4)\\| = \\|S4\\| | 24 | EXACT_INTERNAL | ACTIVE ROOT GENERATOR | none for group order |\n| P04 | \\|Theta\\| | 2^3 = 8 | EXACT_INTERNAL | ACTIVE ROOT GENERATOR | closure/admissibility rule must justify the unique reference state |\n| P05 | N1 | 24 * 8 = 192 | EXACT_INTERNAL | ACTIVE / SECTION-7 DEPENDENCY | any observable interpretation must be derived separately |\n| P06 | Delta_theta | 8 - 1 = 7 | EXACT_INTERNAL | ACTIVE / SECTION-7 DEPENDENCY | continue to preserve the closure-rule proof independently of downstream matches |\n| P07 | G1_default | 4 | COMPUTED_BRIDGE | DEFAULT NATIVE SELECTOR WITH TESTED-SCOPE GUARD | general branch grammar / larger-scope recurrence |\n| P08 | G1_dense | 12 | COMPUTED_BRIDGE | ADMISSIBLE DENSE ALTERNATE | global consistency / dense-bra