    "size_bytes": 5526,
    "content": "# Live UD site crosswalk: idle masks, Hodge margins and event source v0.1\n\n**10 October 2026 UTC. Development — no registry entry.** Constructor replay; independent review pending. Physical promotion **0**.\n\n## Provenance and scope\n\nThe user supplied the additional public [Tetrahedral Packet Complexes site](https://tetrahedral-packet-complexes.ben-w-mayes.chatgpt.site/). Its current edition displays Papers I–III 1.1.1 and Paper IV 0.1. This audit read the site's [idle-mask theorem](https://tetrahedral-packet-complexes.ben-w-mayes.chatgpt.site/#/doc/idleMaskTheorem), [Hodge soft-margin package](https://tetrahedral-packet-complexes.ben-w-mayes.chatgpt.site/#/doc/hodgeSoft), [advanced primer](https://tetrahedral-packet-complexes.ben-w-mayes.chatgpt.site/#/advanced), [Paper I](https://tetrahedral-packet-complexes.ben-w-mayes.chatgpt.site/papers/UD_PAPER_I_REVIEW_DRAFT_v1.1.1.pdf) and [Paper IV](https://tetrahedral-packet-complexes.ben-w-mayes.chatgpt.site/#/doc/paperIV) on 10 October 2026. Site content is an additional source stratum, not an automatic replacement for the supplied coefficient ledger v0.39(2) or a merge of differently typed state spaces.\n\nThe preceding [source-mask transition audit](https://github.com/ud-tetra/UD/tree/main/captures/2026-10-10T160333Z-codex-source-transition-8e38f59e) covered the supplied ledger. This is an append-only extension of its source set. Its statement that the general Q156 product has three closed Boolean decompositions remains true without additional constraints.\n\n## New exact local constraint\n\nThe site's idle-mask theorem defines pair-indexed closure-open response \\(q=1-\\theta\\), hard pair integrity \\(T\\), latent support \\(L\\), viable lane \\(\\omega=T L\\), and intact-null indicator \\(I=T(1-L)\\). The admitted constraints are\n\n\\[\nq\\leq T,\\qquad \\omega\\leq q,\\qquad q=\\omega+h_{\\rm residual},\\quad 0\\leq h_{\\rm residual}\\leq I.\n\\]\n\nThe residual symbol here belongs to the site