enerated or measured switch label. Freeze timing, exclusions, baselines (persistence and close/hold), hashes and code before reading held-out switches; run a fresh independent implementation and publish failures. If only a candidate-driven simulation is available, label it a consistency exercise.\n\n**Governance:** source and version scope above; constructor-only exact algebra; non-constructor review pending, no AUTO_LOCK of autonomous dynamics, no registry promotion, physical promotion 0. This addendum preserves earlier records and narrows the claim rather than overwriting them.\n"
