    "size_bytes": 4284,
    "content": "# Independent OP03 full-endpoint producer handoff v0.1\n\n**11 October 2026 UTC · candidate acquisition specification · no target received.** This adds a full-endpoint lane beside the existing one-pair \\(G_\\Sigma/\\Xi^{FH}\\) bench; it does not modify that bench's frozen predictor or verdict.\n\n## Assignment to an independent producer\n\nProduce a versioned same-carrier sequence on a declared labeled K4 with oriented edges \\((01,02,03,12,13,23)\\) and pair seats \\(A=(01,23), B=(02,13), C=(03,12)\\). The event dynamics or measurement pipeline must be independently specified and committed before outcome acquisition. It must not call, embed, fit, or enforce the UD OP03 receipt-index, burden, seat, no-op, frame or sign/address selector being tested. A separate custodian should attest to authoring and custody; code hashes and declarations alone do not prove independence.\n\nPredeclare the entire acquisition interval and emit **every consecutive candidate and null window**, including holds and no-change outcomes. Freeze event identifiers, previous completed \\(\\Theta\\) event index, ordering, exclusion and eligibility rules before target access. No cherry-picked positive events.\n\n## Pre-event source return, sealed before prediction\n\nFor every window include: producer/version/code hash, run and source packet IDs, orientation/incidence and basis, exact ordered source-complete \\(C_1\\) transport with route selected per producer (original v0.7) **or** independently sourced observed/co-moving 12D transfers with the [memory block gate](https://github.com/ud-tetra/UD/blob/main/captures/2026-10-11T015458Z-codex-source-bridge-8e19b473/REPORT.md) declared in advance; \\(\\theta^-\\); active lineage IDs, predecessor relation, exact continuation/source/renewal maps, pair-seat images, viability/equivalence/collision and pair-integrity certificates; burden history; signed support if the separate polarity diagnostic is desired; raw cochains and source arithmetic adequate for an independent recomputation. All fields must have pre-target hashes and a source/receipt chronology. If a field cannot be produced, return a typed missing-field hold instead of inferring it from the endpoint.\n\nThe UD predictor/custodian computes and hashes all ordered predictions and holds *without access* to target files. The frozen v0.2 protocol and v0.2.1 candidate no-op/seat amendment govern scoring, with the conditional observed-frame route retained as a separate, preselected branch. Preserve null windows in coverage and first-switch denominators.\n\n## Hidden endpoint return, released after prediction hash\n\nFor the **same complete ordered window list**, a separate target lane returns independently observed full relative \\(S_4\\) frame, full \\(\\theta^+\\in\\mathbb F_2^3\\), acquisition and release times, target receipts and source-corruption flags. Include a target seal hash and the producer's code/measurement protocol digest. Target outcomes must not be computed by the UD predictor. Compare frame, event/no-change, timing, budget, pair address and full affine receipt separately. A valid in-domain error falsifies or narrows its corresponding universal candidate claim; finite successes remain scoped.\n\nAn \\(L/T\\)-only sequence or a \\(\\Xi^{FH}\\) target is welcome **for the separately frozen one-pair bench**, but is insufficient for the full endpoint lane. A synthetic or selector-generated series is a control, not independent evidence. A static native Hodge–Dirac run without an independently produced exposure/\\(\\Theta\\) update is also a null/control; it does not generate a positive structural event.\n\n## Return checklist and current state\n\nReturn the independent producer code or measurement specification, hash manifest, raw source windows, pre-event seal, prediction custody barrier, sealed hidden targets, and an external review statement covering independence and chronology. Do not release targets to the predictor before its signed or otherwise auditable prediction hash. The existing [full input contract](https://github.com/ud-tetra/UD/blob/main/captures/2026-10-11T015458Z-codex-source-bridge-8e19b473/INPUT_CONTRACT_v0.1_CANDIDATE.md) and v0.2 acquisition protocol supply the detailed exact gates. **Current submission count: 0. No score has been run. Physical promotion 0.**\n"
