    "content": "# UD K4 cochain contrast receipt candidate v0.1\n\n**12 October 2026. Development lane; frozen target-blind candidate, no registry entry. CANDIDATE constitutive source axiom; EXACT conditional algebra; OPEN UD derivation and physical bridge. Physical promotion 0.**\n\n## Source lock and question\n\nThe current [Paper I v1.1.1 §§4.2, 7.4](https://github.com/ud-tetra/UD/blob/main/captures/2026-10-07T191951Z-codex-ud-bootstrap-5170f8b8/browse/dist/papers/UD_PAPER_I_REVIEW_DRAFT_v1.1.1.md) defines the skew generator but leaves a native event source open. The [direct-Theta interface v0.1, source audit §Source recovery](https://github.com/ud-tetra/UD/blob/main/captures/2026-10-10T170752Z-codex-theta-closure-245626d6/REPORT.md) applies a supplied `xi`, but does not predict it. The [native projection obstruction v0.1 §§General deterministic factorization–Application 1](https://github.com/ud-tetra/UD/blob/main/captures/2026-10-12T014919Z-codex-native-source-97c0393f/THEOREM.md) requires a new pre-event source law to make the fiber singleton. The supplied `UD_COEFFICIENT_PROVENANCE_LEDGER_v0.39(2).md` (22 August 2026, SHA-256 `1281aa8454013fbbdbcf8ada07af0aefe81014003f25a27f3929ad43afffae63`, Q156, Q165–169, Q173) supplies the oriented skew chain carrier and **conditional** mask/current formulas, not a cochain-to-switch map. The supplied CRL-2 subdivision v1.0 (SHA-256 `8e9e8159fe2e5c4bdc234712e02db0151fc77f4a92c140372279a1e9717689a4`) is a governance proposal, not a review receipt. The new `packet_modulation_layer.md`, `triangular_transport_symbol_alphabet.md`, `seam_phase_transport.md`, `coherence_equation.md`, `master_action.md`, `packet_field_equation.md`, `dirac_like_packet_equation.md`, and `carrier_definition.md` attachments are one-line **placeholders** and establish no source law. The `Gap2_FINAL_Finite_Genesis.png` attachment was unavailable and was not read.\n\nThis protocol specifies a falsifiable **candidate** at the native K4 carrier. It is **not