    "note": "Metadata indexed at pinned commit. File content is not necessarily read; Git blob SHA 20b28a73f986a28427d01aaa2e62bf1e20575b3f Full available text is embedded; original claim/review scope remains unchanged.",
    "url": "https://github.com/ud-tetra/UD/blob/47121c4b2d8f472c4eaa977b475d20cc267eed3d/captures/2026-10-13T212305Z-codex-record-entropy-513bfd3d/UD_WRITE_FAULT_AND_COMMON_DEADLINE_v0.1.md",
