    "note": "Original source status. Custody copy only; not new scientific review or promotion. Actual source-generated37x8191x62 record;1893 above frozen threshold;condition<706.570;complete projection tail<9.615e-14. Full sequential run152.8455s,max worker RSS2857156KiB; no286.75GiB Hankel. Exact moment,phase,Gram,Cholesky/SVD residual,energy,action andregression checks PASS. Structured nominal alternative;generic measured-data adapter remains OPEN.",
    "url": "https://github.com/ud-tetra/UD/blob/3064f129f7d541bb3ed4b0a473054ac442018072/captures/2026-10-17T165137Z-codex-nominal-benchmark-b80f21bf/README.md",
