    "content": "# UD session activity record — 16–17 October 2026\n\nThis index records the full accessible session: 17 recovered earlier packages plus nine later immutable captures. All are constructor-side development records. Physical promotion remains **0**; independent review is **not established**. A successful computation or completed task does not promote a physical bridge.\n\n## Earlier work recovered intact\n\nThe original transient checkout is unavailable. These exact archives preserve reports, code, data and source receipts. ZIP CRC and all original manifest entries were checked during this publication; the scientific calculations were not rerun. Original commit references inside archives are provenance records, not reconstructed Git ancestors.\n\n| Activity package | Read report | Download exact archive |\n|---|---|---|\n| 37 INSTRUMENT ERROR CONTRACT | [report](reports/UD_37_INSTRUMENT_ERROR_CONTRACT_v0.1/UD_37_INSTRUMENT_ERROR_CONTRACT_v0.1.md) | [ZIP](recovered/UD_37_INSTRUMENT_ERROR_CONTRACT_v0.1.zip) |\n| 37 PREPARATION CERTIFICATE | [report](reports/UD_37_PREPARATION_CERTIFICATE_v0.1/UD_37_PREPARATION_CERTIFICATE_v0.1.md) | [ZIP](recovered/UD_37_PREPARATION_CERTIFICATE_v0.1.zip) |\n| 600CELL VERTEX LINK OBSERVABILITY | [report](reports/UD_600CELL_VERTEX_LINK_OBSERVABILITY_v0.1/UD_600CELL_VERTEX_LINK_OBSERVABILITY_v0.1.md) | [ZIP](recovered/UD_600CELL_VERTEX_LINK_OBSERVABILITY_v0.1.zip) |\n| BOUNDARY COFRAME MOD13 | [report](reports/UD_BOUNDARY_COFRAME_MOD13_v0.1/UD_BOUNDARY_COFRAME_MOD13_THEOREMS_v0.1.md) | [ZIP](recovered/UD_BOUNDARY_COFRAME_MOD13_v0.1.zip) |\n| COMPRESSED LOCAL VALIDATION | [report](reports/UD_COMPRESSED_LOCAL_VALIDATION_v0.1/UD_COMPRESSED_LOCAL_VALIDATION_v0.1.md) | [ZIP](recovered/UD_COMPRESSED_LOCAL_VALIDATION_v0.1.zip) |\n| DEGREE12 COMPATIBILITY | [report](reports/UD_DEGREE12_COMPATIBILITY_v0.1/UD_DEGREE12_COMPATIBILITY_v0.1.md) | [ZIP](recovered/UD_DEGREE12_COMPATIBILITY_v0.1.zip) |\n| FINITE SIX RATIO CALIBRATION | [repor