VABILITY_v0.1.zip) |\n\n## Later work published as original commits\n\n| Commit | Activity | Capture |\n|---|---|---|\n| `ec303ab` | Certify restricted local fault detection and history operator bounds | [evidence](../2026-10-17T140202Z-codex-restricted-fault-history-e21f46fc/MANIFEST.json) |\n| `610c487` | Optimize restricted validation precision and measurement-count frontier | [evidence](../2026-10-17T142835Z-codex-validation-tradeoff-da0fdb89/MANIFEST.json) |\n| `36ef6e1` | Derive finite-sample noise versus retained-signal frontier | [evidence](../2026-10-17T144006Z-codex-noise-retention-1824b625/MANIFEST.json) |\n| `9c287ea` | Freeze conditional primary acquisition and review contract | [evidence](../2026-10-17T145236Z-codex-acquisition-freeze-ceda2dba/MANIFEST.json) |\n| `6e4bbfb` | Certify storage-limited Hankel spectra and audit parallel monitoring claims | [evidence](../2026-10-17T152126Z-codex-spectral-extraction-3ffbbcbf/MANIFEST.json) |\n| `89eef7d` | Benchmark frozen nominal Hankel pipeline with verified factor Grams | [evidence](../2026-10-17T165137Z-codex-nominal-benchmark-b80f21bf/MANIFEST.json) |\n| `9672289` | Certify record-only Hankel extraction and full-size perturbation controls | [evidence](../2026-10-17T173305Z-codex-record-only-spectrum-fc6e3b97/MANIFEST.json) |\n| `15fd28a` | Certify noisy record proposals and prepare independent review packet | [evidence](../2026-10-17T181003Z-codex-noisy-proposal-6371dfe9/MANIFEST.json) |\n| `6136b5c` | Audit supplied review attestations and hold unbound review claims | [evidence](../2026-10-17T182704Z-codex-review-intake-b8630c6a/MANIFEST.json) |\n\n## Outcomes and corrections\n\n- The 600-cell boundary is a closed 3-sphere; an icosahedral vertex link is a selected 2-sphere, not its manifold boundary. Coframe alignment alone cannot recover an arbitrary projection kernel. Nilpotency does not force torsion flatness. The mod-13 and group-theoretic corrections remain in the boundary/coframe audit.\n- For the