    "note": "Original source status. Custody copy only; not new scientific review or promotion. Seven-page analytic theorem; 49 exact algebra/topology and rational checks; 32 floating Hessian, four centering and four Gauss/covariance controls. Exact 2.5-delta zero-Gauss strict-extension witness. PDF visual QA, static Site checks and full source-patch reconstruction. Constructor work, not independent review.",
