    "note": "Original source status. Custody copy only; not new scientific review or promotion. Three dense-sign seeds and one512-sample correlated-sign pattern certify unique fitted-reference phase matching, errors<0.000502489 radians/sample. Original proposal bytes unchanged. Oversized impulse learns106 components and retains model/order HOLD. 93,950,770 exact additive comparisons; four phase replays;13 tests; five identical raw regenerations. No uniform, independent-review, full-Hankel or physical promotion claim.",
