    "content": "# Typed parity-carrier composition audit v0.1\n\nDevelopment — no registry entry. EXACT CONDITIONAL linear algebra; constructor derivation. Physical promotion:0.\n\n## Source and scoped finding\n\nSource theorem: UD_HODGE_EVENT_RETAINED_PARITY_CARRIER_THEOREM_v0.1, SHA25647fea91d97f8e2c4441b7bab1f1ad06f9a8fc74507f34645433572791d74a863. Its two basic identities are valid under the stated orthonormal embedding and diagonal alignment assumptions. Its subsequent displayed product T_H Theta_H I_c omits an explicit conversion from the retained/event carrier into the Hodge carrier. This is a type/notation gap unless an identification is supplied. Equal dimensions do not supply that identification.\n\nThis audit repairs that display under explicit types. It does not retract the two identities,replay historical blinded outputs,or independently endorse the CRL ruling. Prior source bytes and statuses remain preserved.\n\n## Objects and premises\n\nLet V be the aligned retained carrier and E the event carrier,each with explicit coordinates R^3 plus R^3. They are distinct typed spaces. Let H be the selected rank-six Hodge sector,represented if needed as a subspace of an ambient R^n,n>=6.\n\n- W:E->H is an isometry: W*W=I_E. T=W*:H->E is its inverse on H.\n- R_E=diag(I_3,-I_3) on E and R_V=diag(I_3,-I_3) on V are separately typed.\n- I_c:V->E is diag(c I_3,c^(-1) I_3),c>0,in those declared aligned coordinates.\n- Theta_H=W R_E W* acts on H. Define F=W I_c:V->H.\n- For the symplectic corollary additionally require canonical forms J_E,J_V and the Darboux pullback W* J_H W=J_E. Existence/admission of the specific native W is a source premise,not established by this abstract audit.\n\n## Exact repair and proof\n\nThe two source identities retain their meanings:\n\nT Theta_H=R_E T,\n\nR_E I_c=I_c R_V.\n\nThe first follows from W*W=I_E;the second follows from their aligned block forms. Compose through the explicit F:\n\nTheta_H F = W R_E W* W I_c\n          = W R_E I_c\n          = W I_c R_V\n          = F R_V.\n\nThus the fully typed combined formula is\n\nT Theta_H W I_c = R_E I_c = I_c R_V.\n\nEquivalently,T Theta_H F=R_E T F. Every side maps V->E. The source display T Theta_H I_c is not licensed by these declared maps;one may retain that shorthand only after naming an additional embedding convention,not by silently equating carriers.\n\nNo Hamiltonian,frequency,action normalization,source-formation law or physical observable enters this derivation.\n\n## Selected-sector and symplectic qualifications\n\nOn H,Theta_H^2=I_H. If W is an n-by6 ambient matrix,its zero extension instead satisfies Theta_H^2=P_H=W W*,which is not I_n when n>6. No parity involution on the complement follows.\n\nWith canonical J=[[0,I],[-I,0]],R* J R=-J and I_c* J_E I_c=J_V. The Darboux pullback then gives anti-symplectic parity on H and the typed carrier relation. The positive/negative parity halves are the corresponding rank-three Lagrangian halves under these same premises.\n\nFor the copy swap S=[[0,I],[I,0]],S R S*=-R and S* J S=-J. Consequently a copy-swapped alignment exchanges parity labels and is anti-symplectic relative to this fixed canonical form. It is not the same orientation-preserving symplectic diagonal branch. This spells out a branch distinction;it makes no new claim about which Q121 branch native dynamics selects.\n\n## Proof dependencies and verification limits\n\nThe composition result depends on declared domains/codomains,orthonormal embedding,aligned block action and c>0. The anti-symplectic/Lagrangian corollary additionally needs the form and Darboux premises. It does not depend on a CRL label,custodian ruling,numerical pass count,physical parity identification,SA-023 or independent replication summary.\n\nFresh exact rational checks use a nontrivial Householder embedding into R^15 and c in {1/3,1,5/2}. They verify the formulas and reject the omitted-embedding composition,unjustified ambient involution and unqualified copy-swap branch. These finite witnesses supplement the general algebraic proof above;they do not establish a native Hodge embedding or independent review.\n\nDownstream reuse of the untyped combined display requires this explicit repair or another justified convention. Reuse of the two basic source identities and their stated internal scope remains available. Rendered-text/source-version equivalence,raw Gemini output and named custodian approval remain separate open work under126. The historical ruling is not re-adjudicated. Physical promotion remains0.\n"
